{1010}{NR-No Response}
{1011}{NO RESPONSIBILITY is assumed by this Company, beyond the exercise of due diligence and good faith in the transmission of messages, but their best exertions of their own line, which is in the city of Tarant.}
{1012}{ STOP }

{1020}{Dear Applicant,}
{1021}{Upon extensive review of your application and considering your years of dedicated and steadfast service with the Nodnol Police Dept., we are please to inform you that as of October 18, 1888 you are the newest member of our newly formed Yotland Scard Special Branch.
In addition, you have been appointed the rank of Jr. Detective with the rights and privileges so accorded.
This position is probational of course.
If after a period of time you should prove to show the qualities expected of a detective of the Special Branch, you may retain said rank and position.
You are to meet with your Commander, Chief Shards, by no later than twelve noon tomorrow for further details and instruction.
Good luck and congratulations. ET, NR}
{1022}{Mrs. Judith Harwood,}
{1023}{Human Resources}
{1024}{Mr. Edward Keyes,}
{1025}{Review Board Chairman}